{"id":1122,"level":64,"name":"Змійка — 4 фігури","group":"Майстерність гри фігурами","format":35,"description":"<p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />In this game, you see four black pieces on the chessboard.<br />If you would connect them, they'd form a &lsquo;snake&rsquo;.<br />You have to &lsquo;eat&rsquo; the whole snake with the white piece.</p> <p>Look out! The snake&rsquo;s pieces protect each other.<br />You can&rsquo;t capture a defended piece.<br />So, think before you make your first move.</p> <p>There is always only one undefended black piece.<br />That is the snake&rsquo;s head. Start with taking this head.<br />Now, look for another loose piece and eat that.<br />Then, find the third unprotected black piece and eat it.<br />The final piece is the snake&rsquo;s tail. It is now safe to eat that as well.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":15,"examples":[{"fen":"1r6/8/8/4b3/4r3/8/2b3Q1/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"{[%csl Gc2]} 1. Qxc2 -- 2. Qxe4 -- 3. Qxe5 -- 4. Qxb8 1-0","text":"","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":39071,"fen":"4b3/8/8/4n2r/2r5/8/4Q3/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Qf2 -- 2. Qf8 -- 3. Qe8 -- 4. Qh5 -- 5. Qe5 -- 6. Qe6 -- 7. Qc4  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39096,"fen":"8/8/8/5p2/4p3/3p4/2p2N2/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Nh1 -- 2. Ng3 -- 3. Nf5 -- 4. Nd6 -- 5. Ne4 -- 6. Nc5 -- 7. Nd3 -- 8. Nb4 -- 9. Nc2  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39119,"fen":"3R4/8/8/5n2/4b3/4b3/8/3n4 w - 0 1 $YN","pgn":"1. Re8 -- 2. Re4 -- 3. Re5 -- 4. Rf5 -- 5. Rd5 -- 6. Rd1 -- 7. Re1 -- 8. Re3  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39074,"fen":"8/8/3b4/8/4n3/6r1/3Q4/4r3 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Qe1 -- 2. Qe4 -- 3. Qe6 -- 4. Qd6 -- 5. Qg3  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39077,"fen":"8/8/4Q2b/5n2/4n3/4r3/8/8 w - 0 1 $YY","pgn":"1. Qf5 -- 2. Qh5 -- 3. Qh6 -- 4. Qe3 -- 5. Qe4  1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","is